{"hw":"ἀσέβεια","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἀσέβεια</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἀσέβ-εια</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">ἡ</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">ungodliness, impiety,</b> opp. <span class=\"gk\">ἀδικία, διὰ τὴν ἐκείνων περὶ μὲν θεοὺς ἀ. περὶ δὲ ἀνθρώπους ἀδικίαν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Cyr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">8.8.7</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἀ. εἰς τοὺς θεούς</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Antipho</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5.88</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">R.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">615c</span> </span>, etc.; also <span class=\"gk\">ἀ. ἀπὸ τοῦ θεοῦ</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">LXX</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">2 Ki.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">22.22</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἀ. ἀσκεῖν</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ba.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">476</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">δίκη ἀσεβείας πρὸς τὸν βασιλέα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Lys.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">6.11</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἀσεβείας γράφεσθαί τινα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Euthphr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">5c</span> </span>: at Rome, <b class=\"lex-tr\">disloyalty to the Emperor</b> (as <span class=\"gk\">θεός</span>), <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.C.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">57.9</span> </span>; of Christianity, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">68.1</span> </span>: in pl., <span class=\"gk\">ἀσέβειαι ἀνθρώποις ἐμπίπτουσι νέοις</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Lg.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">890a</span> </span>.</div></div>"}